  sentences:
  - text: 'This is the question i ask myself everyday. '
    tint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: 'If i know the things i make are fake, then why

      do i cheerish them?  '
    tint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: "Why do i believe the black cat is the first i \nadopted and named it Kity
      when i know i \ncreated it myself 2 hours ago in a software? "
