--- !u!114 &1153206845
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1153206844}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: db52dcf5d74d4b14585b41f60cc12a37, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SentenceBuilder
  responseGroup: {fileID: 0}
  isRevealed: 0
  activateOnTrigger: 0
  finishedRendering: 0
  nextGroup: {fileID: 1183534167}
  gapFrames: 6
  sentences:
  - text: "But, leaving all irony aside, don't you think \nthis tree is special?\nIt
      was not created by me, nor by a human, but \nby a program,\n"
    tint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: 'A bunch of 0''s and 1''s can create so much beauty...

'
    tint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: 'I like computers, to be honest, you can make them do

      anything you
      want with enough patience and experience,

'
    tint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: "And, the most important feature of computers are their\navailability.
      You can always use a computer, it doesn't \nhave work to do, it doesn't have
      other friends to hang \nout with,\n "
    tint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: 'and a computer always listenes to you. '
    tint: {r: 0, g: 1, b: 0.65011907, a: 1}
    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  loop: 0
  persistent: 0
  sequentialReveal: 1
  priority: 0
  debugClicks: 0
  activateAfterSeconds: 0
  isTrigger: 0
  triggerOnce: 1
  onTriggerShown:
    m_PersistentCalls:
